            "Built Model.modelName should support special/unicode characters"
        );
    }
    // Scenario 9: Consistency between builder and built Model on modelName value
    @Test
    @Tag("integration")
    public void testModelNameBuilderAndModelConsistency() {
        Builder builder = new AutoValue_Model.Builder();
        builder.modelName("Consistent");
        Model model = builder.build(); // build() returns a Model instance
        Assertions.assertEquals(
            (Optional<String>) Optional.of("Consistent"),
            (Optional<String>) model.modelName(),
            "Built Model.modelName should be consistent with the last value set"
        );
    }
    // Scenario 10: Ensuring no impact to other fields when setting modelName
    @Test
    @Tag("valid")
    public void testModelNameDoesNotAffectOtherFields() {
        Builder builder = new AutoValue_Model.Builder();
        builder.modelName("SomeName");
        // Test via Model since builder.model is private
        Model model = builder.build();
        Assertions.assertEquals(
